C*******************************************************************************
C                          Minimum Percolation Fractions 
C
C   The following lists the fractions for minimum percolation at each finite element.
C
C   DPFL     ;  File that lists the minimum percolation fractions (max. 1000 characters)
C                * Leave blank if minimum percolation is not imposed
C   IE       ;  Element ID (Enter 0 if following values are to be used for all element
C                and non-ponded agricultural crop combinations)
C   ICDPF    ;  Fraction of the "infiltrated" applied water that is going to be 
C                percolation - this number corresponds to the appropriate data column in  
C                minimum percolation factor data file (DPFL).  List for each non-ponded 
C                crop (1 to NCROP).
C
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C         VALUE                                      DESCRIPTION
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                                     / DPFL 
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
C   IE    ICDPF[1]  ICDPF[2] ... ICDPF[NCROP]  
C--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
